      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm looking into a zoning issue in Austin for a client. We have a parcel currently zoned R-1, but we're aiming for a reclassification to Mixed-Use. The main hurdle is a conflict in the municipal code regarding existing setbacks and some minor encroachments from a neighboring structure. Can you help me outline a strategy for navigating these conflicting setback requirements during the rezoning application process?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
